    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U05_L01_Q05</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.SYS.1; MLA.A2.SYS.2</p><p>Which point solves y=x&#178; and y=x+6?</p>]]></text>
